# Each run reports every other step, including the V-rescale application.
# Allow two extra launches per step for the periodic half MATRIX.
# CHECK: domain grid 1 x 1 x 1, nccl transport, unique traversal
# CHECK: INFO: 10
# BONDS: bonds ok
